%C A141493 Taking two periods of A141425 and constructing the triangle of successive signed differences yields the values above (and a few further numbers: 125, 148, 251, 376, 502, 878, 1756). Starting with more than 2 periods of A141425 and other numbers start to show up, such as 14. - _Sean A. Irvine_, Oct 26 2026
